Postgres replica, Stripe export, Web events, Mobile events, CRM dump -> Landing bucket
Landing bucket -> Schema check
Schema check -> Quarantine, Raw tables
Raw tables -> Clean orders, Clean customers, Clean sessions
Clean orders, Clean customers -> Revenue model
Clean sessions, Clean customers -> Funnel model
Revenue model, Funnel model -> Metrics layer
Metrics layer -> Finance dashboard, Growth dashboard, Reverse sync
Reverse sync -> CRM dump
Quarantine -> Data alert
Sources {
  Postgres replica, Stripe export, Web events, Mobile events, CRM dump
}
Warehouse {
  Raw tables
  Staging {
    Clean orders, Clean customers, Clean sessions
  }
  Marts {
    Revenue model, Funnel model, Metrics layer
  }
}
